      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Vertex AI as the managed model platform. I'm actively integrating its identifier into the Python script, `stream_platform_generation.py`, ensuring its presence as a key component of the code.\n\n\n**Implementing the Interaction**\n\nI'm now actively writing the Python code, `stream_platform_generation.py`, and have integrated the Vertex AI library. My immediate focus is creating a function that takes a prompt and model ID, and initiates a streaming prediction request to the platform. I'll make sure to iterate and yield each raw response object from Vertex AI.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863297497,
          "start": 1789863293524
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc2a7254001H9j2DUPIu4e9H4",
