      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Python Script**\n\nI'm focusing on crafting a Python script, specifically `invoke_platform_model.py`. The aim is to make calls to a provider-managed model via a platform client. I've decided to use Google Cloud's Vertex AI as the concrete external provider for this.\n\n\n**Outlining the Implementation**\n\nI'm now concretely outlining the implementation steps. The plan is to create `invoke_platform_model.py` and import the `google.cloud.aiplatform` library. I'll then initialize a Vertex AI client and add prediction request code. Finally, I will include placeholders for user-specific inputs like project, location, and model ID.\n\n\n",
